{"track":"r","id":"r-007","category":"기초 문법","level":3,"title":"결측값을 무시한 평균","desc":"<p>숫자 벡터 <code>x</code>에는 결측값(<code>NA</code>)이 섞여 있을 수 있어요. <code>NA</code>를 <b>빼고</b> 평균을 구해 소수 둘째 자리까지 반올림하는 <code>safe_mean(x)</code>를 만드세요.</p>","starter":"safe_mean <- function(x) {\n}\n","solution":"safe_mean <- function(x) {\n  round(mean(x, na.rm = TRUE), 2)\n}\n","hint":"<p><code>mean(x, na.rm = TRUE)</code> 의 <code>na.rm</code>은 \"NA 제거(remove)\"라는 뜻이에요.</p>","tests":[{"call":"safe_mean(c(1, 2, NA, 4))","expected":2.33,"visible":true},{"call":"safe_mean(c(10, 20))","expected":15,"visible":true},{"call":"safe_mean(c(5, NA))","expected":5,"visible":false},{"call":"safe_mean(c(1, 2, 3, NA, NA))","expected":2,"visible":false}]}